    "marketplace.atlassian.com/rest/2/addons?text=risk|dependency|approval|SAFe|definition of ready|time in status|test management|hierarchy|structure|scriptrunner|workflow validators|BDD gherkin|acceptance criteria|duplicate|bulk edit|rovo agent|glossary|document approval|content archiving|versions",
    "marketplace.atlassian.com/rest/2/addons/<key>/versions/latest?hosting=cloud|datacenter",
    "WebFetch: satıcı MCP dokümanları (Datadog, New Relic, Honeycomb, Dynatrace, Harness, PagerDuty, Endor Labs, Sonatype Guide, Google Cloud MCP, Developer Knowledge, Snowflake, Splunkbase, Asana, ClickUp)",
    "WebFetch: AWS Marketplace AI Agents and Tools, Salesforce AgentExchange, Google Cloud Marketplace AI agents, Claude connectors/plugins dizini, Kiro Powers, Cursor Marketplace, Roadie Tech Insights, Spotify Soundcheck",
    "WebSearch: VS Code private marketplace extensions enterprise GitHub Enterprise 2026",
    "GitHub Actions: claude-code-action, codex-action, run-gemini-cli, dependency-review-action, sbom-action, test reporter eylemleri, issue-metrics"
